WEBVTT

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:10.240
I can't finish reading the magazine pages

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:17.150
I get the feeling that I must read it

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.900
Game cartridges are stacked in the corner of the room

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:30.600
Is there no meaning if I don't play them?

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:35.700
You're on the other side of the table

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:39.070
I'm talking to you, but...

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:46.000
You don't change your facial expression at all

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:52.250
Even though I'm this close to you

00:00:52.750 --> 00:00:59.520
These feelings don't reach you, don't reach you

00:00:59.940 --> 00:01:06.260
What is truly precious?

00:01:09.950 --> 00:01:15.950
DM Quest 2
Yugi the Legendary Hero

00:01:21.300 --> 00:01:23.500
Damn!  I hope this stays up!

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.020
Yugi...

00:01:38.050 --> 00:01:43.250
It was foolish of you to challenge me, kid.

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:47.080
Be quiet!  Your time as a champion is over!

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:48.690
Duel!

00:01:50.660 --> 00:01:52.140
I'm going to win!

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:54.370
Come out, Flame Swordsman!

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:00.230
Then I'll play this card.

00:02:00.480 --> 00:02:01.540
Harpie Lady!

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:04.910
Harpie?

00:02:04.910 --> 00:02:07.140
My monster has greater attack points.

00:02:07.270 --> 00:02:09.070
Go, Flame Swordsman!

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:10.530
How naïve.

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.510
I expected that attack!

00:02:12.850 --> 00:02:14.310
Mirror Wall!

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:20.720
Hang in there!

00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:22.890
I know this attack pattern.

00:02:23.100 --> 00:02:24.120
Can it be?

00:02:25.920 --> 00:02:29.560
You can't hurt my Harpie Lady in a million years!

00:02:29.970 --> 00:02:31.560
Now I'm positive.

00:02:31.560 --> 00:02:34.500
This shrill laugh and crude language...

00:02:34.970 --> 00:02:36.670
It's my turn.

00:02:37.150 --> 00:02:38.440
Rose Whip!

00:02:38.640 --> 00:02:39.770
Wait!

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:44.980
Jonouchi?

00:02:45.240 --> 00:02:46.640
I knew it was you, Mai.

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.280
Yugi?  Mokuba?

00:02:49.500 --> 00:02:51.780
What are you doing here?

00:02:52.020 --> 00:02:54.020
We should be asking you that.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:56.570
My brother has been taken hostage.

00:02:56.660 --> 00:03:00.890
If we don't clear this game, Kaiba's life is in danger.

00:03:01.400 --> 00:03:02.330
Kaiba?

00:03:02.570 --> 00:03:03.360
Yeah.

00:03:03.360 --> 00:03:06.630
Since we're friends, we don't have to fight here.

00:03:06.630 --> 00:03:08.370
What's going on?

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:19.520
But we have to fight to rescue Kaiba.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:23.880
We need that card to cross the desert.

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:27.450
So all you need is that card?

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:32.190
I've been wanting to leave this town myself.

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:33.060
Harpie!

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:37.190
What are you doing?

00:03:37.710 --> 00:03:39.130
It's mine!

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:40.900
Run!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:41.530
Right!

00:03:41.760 --> 00:03:43.140
Don't let them escape!

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.640
They're persistent!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:52.570
Take this!  I activate Trap Hole!

00:03:56.450 --> 00:03:59.120
Are you okay?  That was close!

00:04:00.680 --> 00:04:03.640
It's impossible to walk across this.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:06.640
Mai, use your Niwatori card.

00:04:11.860 --> 00:04:15.020
Why are you here anyway?

00:04:15.170 --> 00:04:21.010
I was invited to test a new game, but then I couldn't escape from this crazy world.

00:04:21.420 --> 00:04:24.010
Mai Kujaku is also trapped in the simulator.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.420
What's going on?

00:04:38.800 --> 00:04:40.600
Sand Stone!

00:04:40.930 --> 00:04:42.400
How annoying!

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:44.620
Come out, Red-Eyes!

00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:50.040
Dark Mega Flare!

00:04:54.820 --> 00:04:56.170
How's that!

00:04:57.640 --> 00:04:58.170
Huh?

00:05:01.550 --> 00:05:04.680
Sand Stone was creating the sandstorm.

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.930
Where should we go?

00:05:06.930 --> 00:05:10.600
I heard that they took my brother to a temple on that mountain.

00:05:26.970 --> 00:05:28.570
We're finally here.

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:30.730
Hey!

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:32.200
Mokuba!

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:36.860
Sheesh.  When it's about Kaiba, he becomes impatient.

00:05:38.150 --> 00:05:40.530
How can this be the inside of a temple?

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:41.680
Creepy.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:43.750
We just have to keep going.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:48.090
I'm opening it.

00:05:55.060 --> 00:05:57.760
No way!  A labyrinth dungeon?

00:05:57.760 --> 00:05:58.900
This looks bad.

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:03.640
It's no good!  We're locked in!

00:06:03.640 --> 00:06:04.840
What should we do?

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:06.110
I see.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:11.370
This world is modeled after our duels in Duelist Kingdom.

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:12.430
That means...

00:06:12.670 --> 00:06:15.140
There must be an exit somewhere ahead.

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:18.180
What was that?

00:06:18.180 --> 00:06:19.200
Is someone there?

00:06:19.200 --> 00:06:20.430
I'm coming!

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.690
Jonouchi!

00:06:22.690 --> 00:06:26.280
Sheesh.  He reacts quickly when he hears a girl's voice.

00:06:26.280 --> 00:06:29.330
And there's a beautiful girl right here with a nice body!

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.270
What?

00:06:32.380 --> 00:06:34.720
Labyrinth Tank!

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:35.710
Run!

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.250
Damn!  Which way?

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:41.470
Jonouchi!

00:06:41.640 --> 00:06:43.010
Run!

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:48.750
I'll turn the tables on them!

00:06:52.110 --> 00:06:53.320
We're surrounded!

00:06:53.630 --> 00:06:55.690
Damn!  Is it over for us?

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:57.080
Don't give up!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:58.840
But still...

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:04.100
Magical Hats!

00:07:16.680 --> 00:07:18.590
We're safe.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:20.280
Nice call, Yugi.

00:07:22.770 --> 00:07:24.060
They're still after us!

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:25.490
Which way should we go?

00:07:27.020 --> 00:07:28.240
You're from before!

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:29.460
A fairy?

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:34.930
In video games, fairies give hints.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:40.450
I think it's guiding us.

00:07:40.570 --> 00:07:41.610
Let's go.

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:45.230
Earu!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.080
Mokuba?

00:07:49.290 --> 00:07:51.320
Why are you dressed like that?

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:53.310
I'm right here, you idiot.

00:07:53.310 --> 00:07:54.270
But...

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:55.530
You look exactly alike.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:56.280
Yeah.

00:07:56.520 --> 00:07:59.010
So you're the one who screamed.

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:00.680
Who are you?

00:08:01.140 --> 00:08:02.720
Save the intros for later.

00:08:02.720 --> 00:08:04.460
Do you know where the exit is?

00:08:05.390 --> 00:08:06.630
No.

00:08:08.400 --> 00:08:10.850
But Earu can lead us.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:15.150
All right!  It's the exit!

00:08:16.530 --> 00:08:19.270
Damn!  I knew it'd show up!

00:08:19.620 --> 00:08:20.950
What is that?

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.730
We don't have a card that can defeat it!

00:08:24.240 --> 00:08:25.450
Leave it to us!

00:08:25.450 --> 00:08:26.510
Let's go, Yugi!

00:08:26.920 --> 00:08:29.130
Red-Eyes B. Dragon!

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:30.940
Summoned Skull!

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.730
Polymerization!

00:08:33.860 --> 00:08:36.530
Come out, B. Skull Dragon!

00:08:44.150 --> 00:08:46.900
So close!  But it's not enough!

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:47.840
We're not done.

00:08:48.600 --> 00:08:52.150
Dragon Nails raises its attack points by 700.

00:08:52.150 --> 00:08:54.090
Go, Meteor Flare!

00:08:57.620 --> 00:08:58.880
Incredible.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.750
Thank you very much.

00:09:00.990 --> 00:09:02.660
How I can repay you?

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:04.080
Don't worry about it.

00:09:04.080 --> 00:09:05.090
Let's go.

00:09:05.400 --> 00:09:08.090
Mary!

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:09.930
Nanny!

00:09:10.290 --> 00:09:12.940
Mary, you're safe!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:16.460
Who are those with you?

00:09:16.860 --> 00:09:19.720
They saved me.

00:09:21.850 --> 00:09:25.410
Please let me thank you for saving me.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.300
Where am I?

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.080
You woke up, Seto Kaiba.

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.570
Witty Phantom.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:09:59.550
What will you do with me?

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:02.480
Do you even need to ask?

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:05.990
You will be sacrificed to Five-Headed Dragon.

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:07.920
Five-Headed Dragon?

00:10:07.920 --> 00:10:12.350
Yes.  The evil god who will transform this world into chaos and shadows.

00:10:13.270 --> 00:10:19.200
The ceremony to resurrect Five-Headed Dragon requires one more sacrifice.

00:10:19.200 --> 00:10:22.300
But that person will arrive soon.

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.900
Let me play this game fair and square!

00:10:27.910 --> 00:10:30.350
Such nonsense.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:34.910
My mission is to do whatever it takes to eliminate you.

00:10:35.110 --> 00:10:38.850
I'm not programmed to let you play.

00:10:39.510 --> 00:10:41.200
What?

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:45.620
Just wait for the next sacrifice to arrive.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:46.870
Why you!

00:10:49.720 --> 00:10:54.300
We agreed to go with them without question, but do you think we can really get home?

00:10:54.480 --> 00:10:55.870
Don't worry.

00:10:55.870 --> 00:10:58.330
Mary doesn't seem to be an enemy character.

00:10:58.330 --> 00:10:59.470
You're right.

00:10:59.470 --> 00:11:03.600
I think that character is modeled after Mokuba.

00:11:03.600 --> 00:11:04.460
Me?

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.200
The Big Five have no taste.

00:11:08.200 --> 00:11:09.020
Be quiet!

00:11:09.520 --> 00:11:10.810
Look at that!

00:11:13.760 --> 00:11:16.990
Wow!  This really is a fantasy world!

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:21.580
There must be a lead to my brother's whereabouts at that castle.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.440
I think Earu likes you.

00:11:35.440 --> 00:11:36.970
Don't tell me you're...

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.430
Yes.

00:11:38.670 --> 00:11:42.710
I'm Princess Mary of Goland.

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.310
Princess?

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:51.990
Jonouchi, slow down!  No one is going to eat your share!

00:11:54.140 --> 00:11:55.500
Are you okay?

00:11:56.940 --> 00:11:58.330
I thought I was going to die.

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:59.870
I warned you!

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:03.610
Princess, have you heard anything about my brother?

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:10.040
Goland and Kosuta in the west must each offer one person for sacrifice every year.

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.570
Sacrifice?

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:12.480
What do you mean?

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:20.200
If we don't offer sacrifices to Five-Headed Dragon, its rage will destroy our nations.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:22.250
Five-Headed Dragon?

00:12:22.440 --> 00:12:27.710
Earu told me that in the west, they already offered a prince.

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:30.230
That must be my brother!  Where is he?

00:12:30.510 --> 00:12:33.160
In the dark castle floating in the sky.

00:12:33.530 --> 00:12:35.000
The dark castle...

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:36.330
...floating in the sky.

00:12:36.570 --> 00:12:38.480
How can we get there?

00:12:38.770 --> 00:12:40.400
Please look at that.

00:12:41.310 --> 00:12:44.340
Legends say that a thousand long years ago...

00:12:44.340 --> 00:12:50.540
...someone escaped from the floating castle and hid a flying ship in these lands.

00:12:50.940 --> 00:12:54.720
But no one knows where it's hidden.

00:12:54.970 --> 00:12:57.150
We should just use a flying monster.

00:12:57.150 --> 00:13:02.080
A monster can't get through the dark floating castle's barriers.

00:13:02.960 --> 00:13:04.080
No way...

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:09.040
Don't worry.  Since this is a game, there must be a way to clear it.

00:13:10.700 --> 00:13:12.200
Don't mind us!

00:13:12.200 --> 00:13:14.640
Anyway, have you decided who'll be sacrificed?

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.400
Yes.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.430
Me.

00:13:19.940 --> 00:13:23.910
But maybe you can save our world.

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:30.820
My country's folklore says that a legendary hero will cross the Horos Mountains and arrive here.

00:13:33.890 --> 00:13:38.730
When the mightiest dragon and soldier stand together, the evil god will be destroyed.

00:13:39.010 --> 00:13:40.810
That's why you went there.

00:13:41.500 --> 00:13:44.440
Are you saying that we're the legendary heroes?

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:45.300
Yes!

00:13:45.390 --> 00:13:48.670
Peace in this land rests upon your shoulders.

00:13:48.910 --> 00:13:51.080
This is what I'm talking about!

00:13:51.080 --> 00:13:53.980
It's turning into a heroic fantasy!

00:13:53.980 --> 00:13:56.130
You're such a simpleton.

00:13:56.130 --> 00:13:59.050
If we're not careful, we'll end up like Kaiba.

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:04.480
But if we don't defeat Five-Headed Dragon, we can't save Kaiba.

00:14:04.480 --> 00:14:06.670
We know what we have to do.

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:09.890
Thank you very much.

00:14:10.170 --> 00:14:12.890
We have heroic attire for you.

00:14:15.880 --> 00:14:18.500
This is getting in the spirit!

00:14:18.860 --> 00:14:20.240
What do you think, Yugi?

00:14:21.240 --> 00:14:22.950
It's a bit embarrassing.

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:25.680
I think it looks good on you.

00:14:25.680 --> 00:14:26.610
Really?

00:14:27.640 --> 00:14:30.640
But Mai, this doesn't involve you.

00:14:30.640 --> 00:14:32.730
You don't need to put yourself in danger.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:35.000
Enough of that!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:37.260
I can't quit midstream.

00:14:37.260 --> 00:14:38.510
Mai...

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:40.420
Where's Jonouchi?

00:14:40.750 --> 00:14:44.400
Why am I the only one who has to dress like this?

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.860
Whatever.  Just come out.

00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:52.690
This isn't fair!

00:14:52.690 --> 00:14:56.540
But this attire is most befitting a hero.

00:14:58.020 --> 00:14:59.140
What is it?

00:15:02.640 --> 00:15:03.740
What's going on?

00:15:06.700 --> 00:15:09.320
It's too dangerous, Princess!  Run away!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.130
They've come to get their sacrifice.

00:15:25.130 --> 00:15:26.360
There are so many!

00:15:27.180 --> 00:15:27.940
Let's do this!

00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:29.480
Dark Witch!

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.340
It's no good.  There's too many.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:37.760
Mai, call back your Dark Witch.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:38.800
What will you do?

00:15:39.080 --> 00:15:40.610
I'll take them down all at once!

00:15:41.120 --> 00:15:42.870
Return, Dark Witch!

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.070
I activate Dark Hole!

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:49.240
Destroy all monsters!

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:51.480
What?

00:15:54.260 --> 00:15:59.200
Oh no!  Armed Ninja's effect can destroy one spell card!

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:02.170
Princess!

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:07.370
Axe Raider, attack using Kunai with Chain!

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:16.480
Princess!

00:16:20.550 --> 00:16:22.510
Oh no...  Mokuba...

00:16:22.510 --> 00:16:23.370
Damn!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:25.910
What do you mean, "Mokuba?"

00:16:26.150 --> 00:16:27.000
You're...

00:16:27.130 --> 00:16:28.080
Princess!

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:29.420
Princess?

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.000
Then who did they take?

00:16:31.560 --> 00:16:33.050
It was Mokuba.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.520
Mokuba said...

00:16:35.920 --> 00:16:37.700
Switch places with me.

00:16:37.700 --> 00:16:41.000
If I'm the sacrifice, they'll take me to my brother.

00:16:41.260 --> 00:16:42.820
It's my fault.

00:16:45.340 --> 00:16:48.400
If I remained the sacrifice...

00:16:48.400 --> 00:16:51.690
Please save Mokuba!

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:54.620
But it's a floating castle.

00:16:56.440 --> 00:16:58.050
How do we get there?

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:02.140
Hey!  Look at that!

00:17:02.140 --> 00:17:03.130
What is it, Yugi?

00:17:03.400 --> 00:17:05.240
What about it?

00:17:05.240 --> 00:17:07.570
It looks like the Nazca Lines.

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:10.240
You're right, but look at the whole thing.

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:13.240
Is that a card?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:15.870
Is that the legendary flying ship?

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:20.820
People of Goland, now is the time to rise up.

00:17:21.110 --> 00:17:28.040
We must send the legendary heroes to the dark floating castle to defeat the source of evil, Five-Headed Dragon.

00:17:28.420 --> 00:17:31.860
In order to do this, we need everyone's help.

00:17:32.200 --> 00:17:37.000
There must be a clue hidden in this town on how to resurrect the flying ship.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:39.740
We must find it!

00:17:41.180 --> 00:17:44.820
Just wait, Kaiba and Mokuba.

00:17:44.820 --> 00:17:46.800
We promise to save you.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:50.010
Unfortunately, we didn't find a thing.

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.770
The ancient texts said nothing.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:54.470
Everyone else?

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.230
We've come so far...

00:17:58.230 --> 00:18:00.300
Don't give up, Jonouchi.

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:01.390
That's right.

00:18:01.390 --> 00:18:04.320
There must be a special trick.

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:06.090
No there isn't!

00:18:06.200 --> 00:18:09.540
The Big Five made an unfair game!

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:13.020
The longer we take, Kaiba and Mokuba will be...

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:16.510
There must be a hint.

00:18:16.640 --> 00:18:18.870
Think!

00:18:19.080 --> 00:18:20.280
There must be...

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:26.330
Long ago, someone escaped from the floating castle and hid a flying ship in these lands.

00:18:27.510 --> 00:18:31.600
Princess!  In the legend, when did the flying ship arrive?

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:33.290
A thousand years ago.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.990
I see!  That's it!

00:18:37.080 --> 00:18:40.430
The flying ship was sealed here a thousand years ago.

00:18:40.680 --> 00:18:42.480
So what?

00:18:42.480 --> 00:18:45.910
We have to return this place to the way it was a thousand years ago.

00:18:45.910 --> 00:18:48.870
A thousand years?  That's not possible!

00:18:49.440 --> 00:18:50.570
It's possible!

00:18:50.570 --> 00:18:51.810
Jonouchi, you can do it!

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:56.600
Yeah.  Do you know why these ruins are shaped like a card?

00:18:56.940 --> 00:19:00.000
Because we need to use a card to restore it!

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:02.750
Jonouchi, you have that card!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:04.340
I see!

00:19:05.810 --> 00:19:08.620
I can use this card to go back a thousand years.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:10.520
Time Wizard.

00:19:10.520 --> 00:19:12.560
But this is an unpredictable card.

00:19:13.080 --> 00:19:15.360
There's no guarantee what it will do.

00:19:15.560 --> 00:19:20.150
No matter what happens, we must save Kaiba and Mokuba.

00:19:21.570 --> 00:19:24.300
Okay.  I'm counting on you, Time Wizard.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.530
Go back a thousand years!

00:19:26.530 --> 00:19:27.510
Time Magic!

00:19:28.340 --> 00:19:29.850
Time Magic!

00:19:47.600 --> 00:19:49.590
What will happen?

00:19:57.310 --> 00:19:59.810
Damn!  It didn't work!

00:20:13.930 --> 00:20:15.890
Oh no!  We need another table!

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.660
Come back soon, Yugi!

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:36.440
Time Wizard's ability restored the flying ship.

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:41.440
By defeating the large monster army, Yugi's team reached the dark floating castle.

00:20:41.440 --> 00:20:44.050
They rescued Kaiba and beat the game...

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:47.340
...is what they thought, but The Big Five had another trap!

00:20:47.340 --> 00:20:49.480
Yugi, come back soon!

00:20:49.480 --> 00:20:51.570
There's trouble in this world too!

00:20:51.570 --> 00:20:56.850
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh!:
DM Quest 3
Dragon Master Knight

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:58.570
Duel, standby!

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:11.480
The flask glistens

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:19.330
Wait for me in the science classroom

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:28.310
If we put our cold hands together

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:36.080
And rub them together, they become warm

00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:41.910
Shower of happiness

00:21:42.200 --> 00:21:46.030
I will shower you with it

00:21:46.350 --> 00:21:54.300
I will support you even when you feel lonely

00:21:54.500 --> 00:21:58.540
Shower of happiness

00:21:58.800 --> 00:22:02.660
You are not alone

00:22:03.040 --> 00:22:09.380
You're protected by a giant ring of friendship
